For any HTTP-exposed Express app, add the following baseline:

```js
const helmet = require('helmet');
const rateLimit = require('express-rate-limit');

app.disable('x-powered-by');           // don't advertise Express
app.use(helmet());                     // sets ~15 secure-by-default headers
app.use(rateLimit({                    // basic abuse protection
